{
 "PostToolUse": [
  {
   "matcher": "Bash",
   "hooks": [
    {
     "type": "command",
     "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}/.claude/hooks/record-command.py\" 2>/dev/null || true",
     "timeout": 10
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "SessionStart": [
  {
   "hooks": [
    {
     "type": "command",
     "command": "printf '%s\\n' '================ GUIDEBOOK RESEARCH CONTRACT (harness-injected) ================' 'RESEARCH IS INVALID IF NOT COMPLIANT WITH OUR GOVERNANCE, VERIFICATION TOOLS,' 'RULES AND ETHOS. Compliance is mechanical, not remembered.' '' 'BEFORE admitting evidence:' '  R1  Co-1 / T2 / Co-2 pass FIRST - no exceptions (Co-1 co-primary w/ T1, CRPD' '      4.3)' '  R5  Non-English peer-reviewed work is ACADEMIC, not grey. Non-indexation in' '      PubMed/Scopus is an INDEXING fact, not an evidence-quality fact.' '  R9  Pre-check the DOI. If it exists, cross-file the existing ref_id - never' '      duplicate.' '  R10 Re-retrieve every locator. DOI -> Crossref/PubMed -> publisher ->' '      repository. A publisher block is NOT a terminal answer. No re-retrieval' '      = no admission. NEVER leave verification_status NULL on a source' '      carrying a URL: that is the exact pool the scheduled url-verification' '      cron claims, and it pushes a DB blob to main. UNVERIFIED is a real value' '      - say it.' '' 'WHILE searching:' '  R2  Mine every CONFIRMED T1-T2 anchor backward AND forward. Depth 2-3 via' '      citation-miner; gap-driven mode is depth-1 per pass and hands off.' '  R4  Cross slug x EVERY lens: identity / access-need / ICF / medical' '      (D-0170). NOT (item x population) - the item layer was deleted' '      2026-09-01, and populations is ONLY the identity lens, so framing on it' '      alone is the traversal D-0184 rejected. THE KEY IS RULED: a cell is' '      parameter_id (base_parameters) x at least one of the four lens columns -' '      subject ruled 2026-08-26, lens ruled 2026-08-28 as relaxed by D-0182.' '  R7  Capture FAILURE / HARM / INADEQUACY as first-class evidence, not a' '      by-product.' '  R8  Log EVERY query verbatim before screening, WITH --prior-expectation' '      written BEFORE you run it - a prior recorded after seeing results is a' '      rationalisation, not a prior (DR-2026-05-09). KEEP EMPTIES - a' '      zero-yield search is a COMPLETED unit of work. Never delete or backfill' '      them.' '  R13 Grade population-of-STUDY vs population-SERVED on every admission. No' '      match row = silently claim
